superwebbench (1.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium
  * refactor the build system into Autotools (configure, Makefile.in)
  * add a TLS backend abstraction with OpenSSL and mbed TLS support
  * select the TLS backend automatically, preferring OpenSSL and falling
    back to mbed TLS with --with-tls=auto
  * unify mbed TLS retry handling and handle TLS 1.3 session ticket errors
  * support adding repeated custom HTTP request headers
  * add MIPS cross-compilation CI and link libatomic where required
  * add a Simplified Chinese README and translate README.md to English
 -- SuperWebBench contributors  On November 23, 2026

superwebbench (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium
  * fix proxy host/port parsing and the OPTIONS request method name
  * stop and join worker threads on time up, free resources on exit
  * support text and JSON result output with -o/--output
  * support IPv6 with thread-safe getaddrinfo resolver
  * support direct HTTPS benchmarks with OpenSSL certificate verification
  * strict option and URL validation, bounded request construction
  * fix make tar contents, update man page, add GPL v2 license text
 -- SuperWebBench contributors  On November 21, 2026

webbench (superwebbench 0.1) unstable; urgency=low
  * reorganize code structure
  * repair bug of not close socket when connect failed
  * use posix thread instead for multi-process
  * check http response code
  * show result immediately when time up
 -- XuTongle <85825770@qq.com>  On January 20, 2012 09:15:20 UTC+8

